# Generated build artifacts — never commit these.
# - lib/ : built from src/ (pnpm run build)
# - dist/ : release bundles
# - vendor/unit-content/artifacts : built worker
# - vendor/*/upstream, vendor/unit-content/artifacts/node_modules : sync intermediates
# vendor/collaboration/artifacts (gateway.mjs + viewer) IS committed: it is a
# self-contained runtime artifact built from univer-cli sources that are not
# available on any registry.
dist/
lib/
node_modules/
*.tgz
*.zip
vendor/collaboration/upstream/
vendor/unit-content/
